7. 🔄 End to end execution flow

This section explains how the integration behaves during execution, from suite execution to final Jira upload.

Flow summary
Start the main functional suite
The suite generates the execution report folder
The listener captures scenario metadata
The test cases write visible steps through JiraReportSteps.note()
Failure evidence is captured when needed
The Jira import suite starts
JiraFlowCoordinator.jiraImport() resolves the report folder
The XML result file is found
JiraReportBuilder builds the custom report model
JiraHtmlTemplateBuilder renders the final HTML
JiraTestPlanManager resolves or creates the Test Plan
JiraGateway.importExecutionResults() creates the Jira execution
JiraGateway.addExecutionToTestPlan() links execution to Test Plan
JiraGateway.updateTestExecution() updates summary, labels, and environment
JiraExecutionPublisher packages report artifacts
Attachments are uploaded to Jira
