Important usage rule in the new project

The new project must also follow the same execution structure:

one real functional suite
one Jira import suite
one collection joining both
sequential execution order

And the new test cases must also use:

CustomKeywords.'jiraIntegration.JiraReportSteps.note'('Business readable step')

This is required if the new report should remain readable and visual.

9. ✅ Recommended implementation checklist

Before saying the integration is ready, validate all the items below:

ematchReport is the only active report listener
main suite and Jira import suite are both inside one collection
collection runs in sequential mode
Jira import test case calls JiraIntegration.jiraImport()
test cases use JiraReportSteps.note() for visible steps
evidence is captured only when really needed
XML is generated correctly
custom HTML report is generated correctly
Test Plan reuse or creation works
Jira execution is created
attachments are uploaded successfully
